docs {
  Every unit the server converts: its spellings, what it measures, the unit it is compared in, and how many of that
  one of it is. Eleven units: six of mass, four of volume, and percent.
  
  A unit that is not listed is still accepted everywhere. It is comparable with itself and with nothing else.
}
